  "definition": "Partial Hospitalization Services",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-03-28",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for He-M 426) #5433, eff 7-2-92; amd by #5971, eff 2-1-95; ss by #7088, eff 8-31-99; ss by #8867, eff 4-13-07; ss by #9285, eff 9-30-08 (from He-M 426.10); ss by #11182, INTERIM, eff 9-29-16, EXPIRES: 3-28-17; ss by #12154, eff 3-28-17",
